<h2>The four elements, unpacked</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Element</th><th>What it means</th><th>How it is proved or attacked</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Factum of separation</td><td>A withdrawal from cohabitation — usually physical departure, exceptionally total withdrawal within one home</td><td>Residence records, correspondence, testimony on the state of the household</td></tr>
